Subject: [PATCH 850/851] Revert "arm64: dts: renesas: r9a09g057: Add RTC node"

This reverts commit 09f116fe80c781d85c9cf8390aa4f3169dc0d8a8.

This reverts the CIP's commit, because tha same commit (d82a0f77999fbc2e1394a4265cc3332ad63ee137)
was applied in the LTS relelase.

Signed-off-by: Nobuhiro Iwamatsu <nobuhiro.iwamatsu.x90@mail.toshiba>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/r9a09g057.dtsi | 15 ---------------
 1 file changed, 15 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/r9a09g057.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/renesas/r9a09g057.dtsi
